OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 11 JUN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Monteverdi
OL,5,     GKate Molleson explores
OL,6,     GMonteverdi's move to Venice,
OL,7,     Gwhere a prestigious post brings
OL,8,     Gnew opportunities alongside
OL,9,     Gupheaval and personal strain.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GSteven Osborne plays live. Author
OL,12,     GDaniel Okrent on his new book
OL,13,     GStephen Sondheim: Art Isn't Easy.
OL,14,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,15,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,16,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,17,     Gfavourites, including works by
OL,18,     GElgar, Florence Price and J.S.
OL,19,     GBach.
