OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 11 JUN
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GTo end their 90th season, the BBC
OL,6,     GScottish Symphony Orchestra are
OL,7,     Gjoined by the BBC Singers and
OL,8,     GChief Conductor Ryan Wigglesworth
OL,9,     Gfor his own Magnificat and music
OL,10,     Gby Bruckner.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Musicians on the Couch
OL,12,     GHow does music affect the mind?
OL,13,     GWriter Amanda Dalton looks at
OL,14,     Gfascinating musical mysteries,
OL,15,     Glike Hildegard of Bingen's
OL,16,     Gvisionary compositions.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
